            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Unstable Manifestation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The hound disappears when it is reduced to 0 Hit Points, when its creator has the Incapacitated condition, or when its creator dies. The hound leaves no remains. A creature adjacent to the hound can use an action to attempt a DC 13 Intelligence (Investigation), Wisdom (Insight), or Charisma (Performance) check, describing how it confronts or transforms the memory visible inside the hound. On a success, the hound disappears."
            },
